### create schedule

POST {{baseUrl}}/schedule/create HTTP/1.1
Authorization: {{administrator}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "endTime": "2026-05-10T17:00:00Z",
  "location": "123 Main Street, Dhaka",
  "scheduleDate": "2026-05-10T00:00:00Z",
  "startTime": "2026-05-10T08:00:00Z",
  "workScope": "Interior painting for 3rd floor"
}


### get all schedules

GET {{baseUrl}}/schedule/all-schedules HTTP/1.1


### get all schedules filtered by month and year

GET {{baseUrl}}/schedule/all-schedules?month=5&year=2026 HTTP/1.1


### get all schedules with search

GET {{baseUrl}}/schedule/all-schedules?search=painting HTTP/1.1


### get all schedules with month, year and search

GET {{baseUrl}}/schedule/all-schedules?month=5&year=2026&search=floor HTTP/1.1


### get schedule by id

GET {{baseUrl}}/schedule/69df17c8ac9d6efd200fea7e HTTP/1.1


### update schedule

PATCH {{baseUrl}}/schedule/69d5e22bc6771df1addec900 HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "endTime": "2026-05-10T18:00:00Z",
  "location": "456 Side Street, Dhaka",
  "startTime": "2026-05-10T09:00:00Z",
  "workScope": "Exterior painting for ground floor"
}


### delete schedule

DELETE {{baseUrl}}/schedule/69d5e22bc6771df1addec900 HTTP/1.1
